            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeoncraft is a real-time fantasy strategy game about leading a small company, with the world set out on a tabletop and your companions’ equipment laid beside it as cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your company within reach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character commands nearby companions, who can pass orders farther along. Reaching someone cut off from the others takes a courier. The runner has to leave their work, reach the recipient, and return, so spreading out means allowing time for instructions to arrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose how your companions act</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside their equipment, companions can carry creeds: rules for how they behave without a direct order. A creed can change whom they attack or when they retreat, and different copies can carry different rules. Your own orders take priority.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take the company underground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through the undercroft, cistern, and crypt, carrying wounds and supplies between floors. Other scenarios put the company to work on machinery, construction, and the hazards of the terrain.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeoncraft is a real-time fantasy strategy game about leading a small company, with the world set out on a tabletop and your companions’ equipment laid beside it as cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep your company within reach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character commands nearby companions, who can pass orders farther along. Reaching someone cut off from the others takes a courier. The runner has to leave their work, reach the recipient, and return, so spreading out means allowing time for instructions to arrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose how your companions act</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside their equipment, companions can carry creeds: rules for how they behave without a direct order. A creed can change whom they attack or when they retreat, and different copies can carry different rules. Your own orders take priority.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take the company underground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through the undercroft, cistern, and crypt, carrying wounds and supplies between floors. Other scenarios put the company to work on machinery, construction, and the hazards of the terrain.</p>",
            "short_description": "Lead a small company in a real-time fantasy strategy game played across a tabletop. Equip your companions, choose the creeds that guide their behaviour, and get orders to distant units through relays and couriers.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Alemão, Chinês simplificado",
